    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience psychological horror in a 3rd Reich setting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1944, on behalf of the OSS, you are sent to a waterworks near the Schneiden in the heart of Germany. According to reports, a Nazi scientist is researching how to resurrect fallen soldiers as ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the way there, Jason is haunted by ghostly apparitions and the cries of women and babies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a legend in Schneiden about a woman in a white dress who was captured and killed by the Nazis together with her child. Since then, she is said to come back again and again to take revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/extras/d1b6837371699931d0e1f6f67f3cf891.avif?t=1751987026\" width=658 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEAR of Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the German Wehrmacht and stop the Nazi scientist's paranormal experiments before it's too late.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to fight \u201cErna\u201d the woman in the white dress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of shocking and paranormal events and face your fears as you unravel this terrifying mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/extras/a277297332f4974663ac7d350b5243b7.avif?t=1751987026\" width=658 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All light sources are dynamic and can be destroyed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The English and German languages are an integral part of the immersion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up-close action in many outdoor and indoor scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience psychological horror in a 3rd Reich setting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1944, on behalf of the OSS, you are sent to a waterworks near the Schneiden in the heart of Germany. According to reports, a Nazi scientist is researching how to resurrect fallen soldiers as ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the way there, Jason is haunted by ghostly apparitions and the cries of women and babies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a legend in Schneiden about a woman in a white dress who was captured and killed by the Nazis together with her child. Since then, she is said to come back again and again to take revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/extras/d1b6837371699931d0e1f6f67f3cf891.avif?t=1751987026\" width=658 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEAR of Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the German Wehrmacht and stop the Nazi scientist's paranormal experiments before it's too late.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to fight \u201cErna\u201d the woman in the white dress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of shocking and paranormal events and face your fears as you unravel this terrifying mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/extras/a277297332f4974663ac7d350b5243b7.avif?t=1751987026\" width=658 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All light sources are dynamic and can be destroyed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The English and German languages are an integral part of the immersion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up-close action in many outdoor and indoor scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
